<title>USA: Risk of showers in West Africa cocoa areas  -WSC.</title>
<headline>Risk of showers in West Africa cocoa areas  -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Risk of a few afternoon thundershowers is seen in West Africa cocoa areas but above normal temperatures continue to stress trees in Ivory Coast and Ghana, forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>It notes that moisture and humidity levels are favourable, however.</p>
<p>The outlook is for little change Saturday-Monday.</p>
</text>
